<!-- ============ THE PROBLEM ============ -->
<section class="pb-24 bg-jh-earth-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 reveal">
        <p class="text-jh-terracotta-600 font-bold text-sm diamond-bullet flex items-center">Why SamadhanSetu</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-jh-green-900 mt-4 leading-tight">Good intentions, disconnected everywhere</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-jh-earth-700 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Every day, citizens face unresolved issues — broken roads, water scarcity, forest degradation, and delayed public services. Meanwhile, students and faculty have ideas but no real problems to work on. Industry wants meaningful CSR, but lacks transparent, verifiable projects to fund.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex gap-6">
          <div>
            <p class="font-heading font-extrabold text-3xl text-jh-terracotta-600">6+ months</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-jh-earth-600 mt-1">average time a rural civic issue stays unresolved</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-heading font-extrabold text-3xl text-jh-terracotta-600">1000s</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-jh-earth-600 mt-1">of student capstone projects that never reach the ground</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
        <div class="reveal bg-white border border-jh-earth-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-jh-soft">
          <svg class="w-9 h-9 text-jh-green-700" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 21c-4-4-7-7.5-7-11a7 7 0 0114 0c0 3.5-3 7-7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.4"/></svg>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mt-4 text-jh-green-900">Reports without follow-up</h3>
          <p class="text-jh-earth-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Citizens raise issues but rarely see verification or resolution.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal bg-white border border-jh-earth-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-jh-soft sm:mt-8">
          <svg class="w-9 h-9 text-jh-green-700" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 19.5V6a2 2 0 012-2h9l5 5v10.5a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/><path d="M13 4v5h5"/></svg>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mt-4 text-jh-green-900">Projects stuck as papers</h3>
          <p class="text-jh-earth-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Student and faculty research rarely turns into a working, deployed solution.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal bg-white border border-jh-earth-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-jh-soft">
          <svg class="w-9 h-9 text-jh-green-700" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M4 20h16M6 20V10m4 10V6m4 14v-8m4 8V4"/></svg>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mt-4 text-jh-green-900">Scattered government data</h3>
          <p class="text-jh-earth-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Officers juggle disconnected records with no single source of ground truth.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal bg-white border border-jh-earth-200 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-jh-soft sm:mt-8">
          <svg class="w-9 h-9 text-jh-green-700" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"/><path d="M12 7v5l3.2 2"/></svg>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg mt-4 text-jh-green-900">CSR without measurable outcomes</h3>
          <p class="text-jh-earth-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">Funding reaches communities, but its on-ground impact is hard to trace.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ HOW IT WORKS ============ -->
<section id="how-it-works" class="py-24 bg-jh-green-900 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute -right-24 -top-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-jh-green-700/30 blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 relative">
    <div class="max-w-2xl reveal">
      <p class="text-jh-gold-400 font-bold text-sm diamond-bullet flex items-center">How it works</p>
      <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-jh-earth-50 mt-4">One problem, five hands, one platform</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-8 md:gap-4 relative">
      <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-7 left-[10%] right-[10%] h-0.5 step-line"></div>

      <div class="reveal relative">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-jh-earth-50 text-jh-green-900 font-heading font-extrabold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-jh-glow">1</div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-jh-earth-50 mt-5">Citizen reports</h3>
        <p class="text-jh-earth-200/85 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Upload an issue with photo, location &amp; description — even by voice, in local languages.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal relative">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-jh-earth-50 text-jh-green-900 font-heading font-extrabold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-jh-glow">2</div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-jh-earth-50 mt-5">Officer verifies</h3>
        <p class="text-jh-earth-200/85 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">The Nodal Officer validates the issue on ground and sets its priority.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal relative">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-jh-earth-50 text-jh-green-900 font-heading font-extrabold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-jh-glow">3</div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-jh-earth-50 mt-5">Students &amp; faculty build</h3>
        <p class="text-jh-earth-200/85 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Verified issues become live R&amp;D projects and working prototypes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal relative">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-jh-earth-50 text-jh-green-900 font-heading font-extrabold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-jh-glow">4</div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-jh-earth-50 mt-5">Industry sponsors</h3>
        <p class="text-jh-earth-200/85 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Companies fund the highest-impact projects with full transparency.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal relative">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-jh-earth-50 text-jh-green-900 font-heading font-extrabold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-jh-glow">5</div>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-jh-earth-50 mt-5">Everyone tracks progress</h3>
        <p class="text-jh-earth-200/85 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Real-time status and impact metrics, visible to the public.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a href="#roots" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-14 text-jh-gold-400 font-semibold hover:text-jh-gold-500 reveal">
      See the detailed flow
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ WHO IS IT FOR ============ -->
<section id="focus-areas" class="py-24 bg-jh-earth-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl reveal">
      <p class="text-jh-terracotta-600 font-bold text-sm diamond-bullet flex items-center">Who it's for</p>
      <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-jh-green-900 mt-4">Six roles, one shared mission</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

      <div id="report" class="persona-card reveal bg-white rounded-xl shadow-jh-card border-t-4 border-jh-terracotta-600 p-7">
        <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-jh-terracotta-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 21c-4-4-7-7.5-7-11a7 7 0 0114 0c0 3.5-3 7-7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.4"/></svg>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-jh-green-900 mt-5">Citizen</h3>
        <p class="text-jh-earth-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Report issues, track their progress, and see real change in your area.</p>
        <a href="#" class="inline-block mt-5 font-bold text-jh-terracotta-600 hover:text-jh-terracotta-700">Report an Issue →</a>
      </div>

      <div id="student" class="persona-card reveal bg-white rounded-xl shadow-jh-card border-t-4 border-jh-green-700 p-7">
        <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-jh-green-700" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M22 9L12 4 2 9l10 5 10-5z"/><path d="M6 11v5c0 1.5 2.7 3 6 3s6-1.5 6-3v-5"/></svg>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-jh-green-900 mt-5">Student</h3>
        <p class="text-jh-earth-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Work on real problems, build live prototypes, and gain skills that matter.</p>
        <a href="#" class="inline-block mt-5 font-bold text-jh-green-700 hover:text-jh-green-800">Join as Student →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="persona-card reveal bg-white rounded-xl shadow-jh-card border-t-4 border-jh-gold-500 p-7">
        <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-jh-gold-600" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"/><path d="M3 9v6c3 2 15 2 18 0V9"/></svg>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-jh-green-900 mt-5">Faculty</h3>
        <p class="text-jh-earth-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Mentor student teams on projects that create real societal impact.</p>
        <a href="#" class="inline-block mt-5 font-bold text-jh-gold-600 hover:text-jh-gold-500">Mentor Projects →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="persona-card reveal bg-white rounded-xl shadow-jh-card border-t-4 border-jh-indigo p-7">
        <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-jh-indigo" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 3l8 4v5c0 5-3.5 7.5-8 9-4.5-1.5-8-4-8-9V7l8-4z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-jh-green-900 mt-5">Nodal Officer</h3>
        <p class="text-jh-earth-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">Verify, prioritise, and monitor issues across your jurisdiction.</p>
        <a href="#" class="inline-block mt-5 font-bold text-jh-indigo hover:opacity-80">Officer Login →</a>
      </div>

      <div id="industry" class="persona-card reveal bg-white rounded-xl shadow-jh-card border-t-4 border-jh-terracotta-400 p-7">
        <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-jh-terracotta-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M3 21V9l6-4 6 4v12"/><path d="M15 21V13l6-3v11"/><path d="M9 21v-4h2v4M13 21v-6h2v6"/></svg>
